---
title: Domain categorisation tool
member: fazna
year: '2025'
summary: >-
  Sorts hundreds of website domains into categories in seconds, one at a time
  or in bulk from Google Sheets, Excel or CSV.
featured: true
---
Categorising domains by hand was a slow, repetitive part of the team's analysis. Fazna built a tool that reads each site and assigns its category with a light text-classification model, using Python, Pandas and BeautifulSoup. It has already saved the team hours of manual work.
